# Cloudflare Pages headers (see https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/)
#
# CSP is ENFORCING (flipped 2026-07-17 after AFU's clean live smoke: real-phone
# drawers/cards/compare + signed-in email/Google/contribute-unlock, zero console
# violations during the Report-Only window since 2026-07-03).
# script-src needs 'unsafe-inline' because Astro inlines the small per-page module
# script; Clerk loads from clerk.malaysiapg.com.my (host decoded from pk_live) and
# may embed Cloudflare Turnstile (challenges.cloudflare.com). JSON-LD blocks are
# data, not executed - CSP does not apply to them.
# static.cloudflareinsights.com: Cloudflare auto-injects the Web Analytics beacon
# at the edge (not in our HTML; verified via live network trace 2026-07-03); its
# RUM POST goes to same-origin /cdn-cgi/rum (connect-src 'self'). Clerk's blob:
# script is a Web Worker (worker-src blob:), not a script element.
# *.clarity.ms + c.bing.com: Microsoft Clarity (heatmaps/session replay, added
# 2026-10-21 with AFU's OK; privacy page updated the same day).
#
# Cloudflare Pages adds "access-control-allow-origin: *" to every response by
# default; we detach it site-wide and re-add it only for /api/* (the JSON API is
# meant to be fetched cross-origin, HTML pages are not).

/*
  ! Access-Control-Allow-Origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://clerk.malaysiapg.com.my https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://*.clarity.ms https://c.bing.com; connect-src 'self' https://clerk.malaysiapg.com.my https://clerk-telemetry.com https://*.clarity.ms https://c.bing.com; img-src 'self' data: https://img.clerk.com https://*.clarity.ms https://c.bing.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'

/api/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

# hashed build assets never change content under the same filename
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
